# Copy to .env.local. Testnet RPC endpoints only: read-only, no keys.
# Both are optional: when empty, the app uses the public endpoints
# (https://sepolia.base.org and https://api.devnet.solana.com), which work but
# rate-limit. A keyed provider URL here avoids that. These are NEXT_PUBLIC_, so
# they ship to the browser: never put a mainnet or write-capable key here.
NEXT_PUBLIC_BASE_SEPOLIA_RPC_URL=
NEXT_PUBLIC_SOLANA_DEVNET_RPC_URL=
